  "description": "Im Da-Heon, the adorable youngest member of the rookie idol group NIJ. There’s one problem for Jeo Chae-Do, a well-known fan who’s obsessed with him. It’s the fact that his favorite idol is actually his childhood friend! Chae-Do, who continues to fangirl while constantly worrying that his true identity will be exposed, hears Da-Heon say something meaningful at a fan signing event one day. Chae-Do begins to feel something different toward Da-Heon than he usually does... \n\n *“I like him as my favorite idol and as my childhood friend, but I...”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
